# Revenue Per Session Analysis

## 📌 Project Overview

This project analyzes website sessions and revenue performance to understand how effectively website traffic contributes to business revenue.

The analysis focuses on identifying trends in website sessions, revenue generated, and revenue per session over time.

## 🎯 Business Questions

- How many website sessions were recorded?
- How much revenue was generated?
- What is the revenue per session?
- How does website traffic change over time?
- How does revenue change over time?
- Are increases in website sessions translating into higher revenue?

## 🛠️ Tools Used

- Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX

## 📊 Key Analysis

The dashboard provides an interactive view of website performance, allowing users to explore revenue, website sessions, and revenue per session across different periods.

## 💡 Key Insights

The analysis helps identify periods of strong and weak website performance and provides a clearer understanding of the relationship between website traffic and revenue.

